#: ../../tools/elixir_tess_tools.rst:32 0cc9948064e149f6bf28ac8c06247047
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search ELIXIR TeSS for upcoming and past bioinformatics "
"training events, workshops, and courses. TeSS aggregates events from "
"ELIXIR nodes and partner organizations across Europe and worldwide. "
"Returns event details including organizer, location (online or physical),"
" dates, costs, and registration links. Useful for finding bioinformatics "
"training opportunities."
msgstr ""

